                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Avoid. \nEven if this game were free, the gameplay is just too non-fun to justify. \nEven if I had three friends helping me (it is up to four player co-op, though specifically this is shared/split screen COUCH co-op) it would still be very annoying as the individual maps are so tiny. \nI paid $1.49 USD for this and played for 0.2 hours and that was enough to decide to ask for a refund. \nThis review is being left on 2026-08-24, and according to the Steam page, the game has not been updated since its 2016 release.",
